cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: GULLIVER behaviour classifier
abstract: >-
  Classify gull behaviour from Movebank GPS and acceleration exports. Each
  burst of 20 acceleration samples, with the ground speed of its GPS fix, gets
  one of 9 behaviour classes from a small trained convolutional neural network.
